+/// The Buzz half of the memory-ingress wire contract (spec §3).
+///
+/// Each test builds the `FlushBatch` equivalent to one scenario of
+/// `tests/fixtures/buzz-acp-prompt-blocks.json` and asserts the wire metadata
+/// only: the block count, *which* blocks carry `_meta`, and the payloads.
