+/// `<CARGO_TARGET_DIR>/opc-memory-ingress-dump.json`, which
+/// `tests/memory-ingress-meta.sh` deep-compares against the fixture. That is the
+/// link that keeps this in-image test and the in-repo golden payload honest
+/// about each other.
